{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features for this demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 playable deck. The full game will have 8 decks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">69 unique Nova Cards that alter the game significantly. The full game will have 150+ Nova Cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive visual effects that will make you want to come back over and over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/58c70e13bf79bc2b622797e3b6ff9a34.poster.avif?t=1753276643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/58c70e13bf79bc2b622797e3b6ff9a34.webm?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/58c70e13bf79bc2b622797e3b6ff9a34.mp4?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tactical domino placement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the highest possible score by expanding your domino web. Unfold the cosmic plane and optimise your domino placing route to collect as many resources as you can.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/062a1880eee3312515e1313714e2787b.poster.avif?t=1753276643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/062a1880eee3312515e1313714e2787b.webm?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/062a1880eee3312515e1313714e2787b.mp4?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage the cosmic plane</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The bigger your domino web, the more vulnerable you become. Each turn the plane changes so you will have to improvise to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/7d382234ad5fb2ec5ef0e540597ca21c.poster.avif?t=1753276643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/7d382234ad5fb2ec5ef0e540597ca21c.webm?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/7d382234ad5fb2ec5ef0e540597ca21c.mp4?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage your resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect cash, upgrade your deck and buy Nova Cards to create crazy synergies and tactical variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/bbeba5162c6524aba52e9344db35b17b.poster.avif?t=1753276643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/bbeba5162c6524aba52e9344db35b17b.webm?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/bbeba5162c6524aba52e9344db35b17b.mp4?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Satisfying visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a cosmic dance of colors and special effects. The higher you score, the more visually exciting the dance becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/561a39129c3b36646ec6f9a3b13833a5.poster.avif?t=1753276643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/561a39129c3b36646ec6f9a3b13833a5.webm?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/561a39129c3b36646ec6f9a3b13833a5.mp4?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dynamic board elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the cosmic elements have an effect on eachother. Fire, explosives, ice, electricity, darkness, water and more. This makes every new playthrough dynamic and different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855790?t=1753276643","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/b9d7f8e0251c48e8a76d0f8086e481b487786790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753276643","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/b6ceb36ce0783f4cf7635c0811deea4d68644e6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753276643","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/b6ceb36ce0783f4cf7635c0811deea4d68644e6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753276643","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features for this demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\