ll have to improvise to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/7d382234ad5fb2ec5ef0e540597ca21c.poster.avif?t=1753276643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/7d382234ad5fb2ec5ef0e540597ca21c.webm?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/7d382234ad5fb2ec5ef0e540597ca21c.mp4?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage your resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect cash, upgrade your deck and buy Nova Cards to create crazy synergies and tactical variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/bbeba5162c6524aba52e9344db35b17b.poster.avif?t=1753276643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/bbeba5162c6524aba52e9344db35b17b.webm?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/bbeba5162c6524aba52e9344db35b17b.mp4?t=1753276643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Satisfying visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a cosmic dance of colors and special effects. The higher you score, the more visually exciting the dance becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855790/extras/561a39129c3b36646ec6f9a3b13833a5.poster.avif?t=1753276643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a